# This tool's worker image. caos/imgtools for the FIRST stage only: it reads the
# pinned emsdk config with skopeo and assembles the worker image around it, and
# skopeo is what that needs. Every later stage runs on the image it assembles.
../../caos/imgtools imgtools

# The Nim deps job runs on caos/nim, exactly as it does for `build` and `test`:
# nimby clones 28 repos and the result is Nim SOURCE, which is the same tree
# whichever compiler later reads it. Sharing the job is what keeps the wasm
# build from re-fetching them.
../../caos/nim nim
